#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG9670 expect=noViolation domain=SE
# Rule:Description: CDISC-CG9670 — the Required key USUBJID is not populated.
#note "USUBJID populated -> noViolation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of USUBJID."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset SE
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SESEQ type=Char
col ETCD type=Char
---
S1      | SE     | S1-001  | 1     | SCRN
---
